{
  "_comment": [
    "Generate-time Neon validation rules, shared by Go (validateNeonConfigMap)",
    "and the web UI (web/src/utils/neonValidation.ts).",
    "",
    "config is an env document, as loaded from YAML, with only the keys the",
    "rules read. want is the set of rule ids the config breaks: empty means",
    "valid. A validator reports every problem at once, so a case may name",
    "several rules. Order in want carries no meaning.",
    "",
    "V-N16 (two equal role names) is not here: a 32-bit id collision cannot be",
    "written as a plain config, and the web UI does not check it.",
    "All ids are placeholders."
  ],
  "vectors": [
